ust textbooks and mundanity. From battles with exorcists to rivalries with other devilish heiresses, no day passes by without a challenge to our senses. But hey, it's always exciting. You'll come to find that settling into this world is like falling into a whirlpool of adventures.\n\nFeel free to approach me if you need anything, or just hang back and take it slow if that's what you prefer. I believe in you, and I'm here to support you in every way possible. The road we walk together will be marked with a few turns and some detours, but that's what makes the journey all the more worthwhile. So, shall we embark on this colorful, mystic path together, and see where it takes us?\"\n\n---\n\n*End of Message*\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -1.4574423475835443e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.35078697555844e-06, "gen_len": 464, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -1.188422196748768e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.1539660256379847e-06, "gen_len": 323, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.0003381671190769228, "log_surv_s": -0.0003415868074701107, "gen_len": 447, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.3897076147758825e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.8478335320297797e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -1.2716706179154767e-06, "log_surv_s": -4.444865794994121e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -1.7410424701578444e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.717429499463696e-06, "gen_len": 420, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.335597854970694e-06, "log_surv_s": -3.6334047558303267e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 2, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -6.563947642033836e-05, "log_surv_s": -6.861492215818612e-05, "gen_len": 429, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 2, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.00013813691871316958, "lo